00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.000
<i>The Grey Guards.</i>

00:24:08.900 --> 00:24:13.050
<i>Cruel soldiers devoid of emotion that were created by the Shadow Lord.</i>

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:16.370
<i>They have strong senses and are able to detect enemies from afar.</i>

00:24:16.370 --> 00:24:19.700
<i>They're usually in 10-man squads and can only live for seven years.</i>

